  "2026-08-14T07:55:38.327Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: SDK validation now rejects missing assertion_ids/triggers arrays and invalid trigger vocabulary with AssuranceMutationRefusalError; CLI normalization produced stable exit 2 in the packed temporary project (no raw TypeError). The same 9-trigger vocabulary is published by command-scoped contracts. Linked assurance tests passed; final repo coverage passed 7,288 tests at exact 100/100/100/100."
  "2026-08-14T08:30:18.314Z","harness:codex","Live Sentry baseline before exact-head replay: unresolved issue PM-CLI-34 (https://unbrained.sentry.io/issues/140606819/) is the reported missing-gate TypeError, count=3, firstSeen 2026-08-14T05:11:29Z, lastSeen 2026-08-14T05:12:15Z, release pm-cli@2026.8.14, tagged pm.error_code=unclassified_runtime_error and pm.exit_code=1. Final acceptance must replay the omission on the fixed exact head, observe typed exit 2, and verify this issue does not advance."
  "2026-08-14T08:51:51.359Z","harness:codex","Exact-head acceptance evidence: a freshly packed npm consumer invoked the missing gate.triggers path and returned exit 2 with code invalid_argument_value plus the complete pre-commit, pre-push, pre-merge, ci, pre-release, post-release, scheduled, on-claim, on-close vocabulary. Direct JSON-RPC processRpcLine replay returned isError=true with structured code 2 and the same typed detail, with no raw TypeError. Sentry PM-CLI-34 remained unresolved at count=3 and lastSeen=2026-08-14T05:12:15.844Z after both fixed-head replays, proving the expected-usage refusal no longer advances the unclassified runtime issue. The focused 115-test review suite, hosted exact-head checks, contracts, SDK surface, token surface, and surface replication gates passed. The temporary packed directory was removed after verification."
  "2026-08-14T09:31:42.126Z","harness:codex","Final live observability confirmation: Sentry PM-CLI-34 remains count=3 and lastSeen=2026-08-14T05:12:15.844Z after fixed-head CLI/MCP/packed replays. The final 7,288-test run passed at exact 100/100/100/100, including the missing after_index cursor branch and package-subpath typed-refusal coverage."
  "2026-08-14T10:02:42.574Z","harness:codex","Production closeout 2026-08-14: PR #1013 exact head cd6d04061 merged as a7f68fb84 with all hosted checks green and final CodeRabbit commit-pinned review reporting no actionable issue. Sentry PM-CLI-34 is now resolved and remains exactly count=3, lastSeen=2026-08-14T05:12:15.844Z, release pm-cli@2026.8.14; fixed-head CLI, MCP, and packed-consumer replays produced no recurrence. Telemetry flush at 2026-08-14T09:59:51.345Z drained 1 of 1 queued events and reported queue_progressed=true plus queue_empty=true."
